title: "Unify the non-JSON assignment fallback grammar for the privacy scanner (numeric descendants, reference suffix adjacency, split literals)"
description: "GH issue #66: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-memory/issues/66 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-13T01:35:25Z · updated 2026-11-13T06:54:43Z"
